-- Schema for CBR request (call) handling, based on [RS] OM/GSE integration with local CBR spec.
-- Napomene:
-- - TBL_CBR_TRANSACTION referencira ID iz TBL_CBR_TRANSACTION_REQUEST (REQUEST_ID).
-- - CALL_REPLY_REF ostaje jedinstven za korelaciju, ali primarni kljuc je ID.
-- - Agent kolone bez sufiksa _BIC; ID razdvojeni (BIC/LEI/OTHR/PRVTID).
-- - Address country/text izbaceni; postal address dodate.
-- - DR/CR statistical code u glavnoj tabeli; child stat bez event datuma/drzave.
-- - Request tabela sadrzi samo sirovi XML + status/izvor.

